This is a suit filed by the plaintiff against the defendants to pass a judgment and decree:
 To decree jointly and severally upon the defendants a fair and just compensation of a sum of 1,00,00,000/- (Rupees One Crore only) or such higher sum, to redress the The Management Vidya Soudha Public ... vs Narasimha Murthy T on 2 September, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/5202505/
2 injury caused from the loss of reputation of the plaintiff due to the publication of the purported news;

29. Issue No.3: - The plaintiff in this case has sought the relief of :
(i)  1 Crore compensation;
(ii) Permanent injunction against further defamatory broadcasts and (iii) Mandatory injunction for apologies.

